    "ideas": [
      "Perimeter is the distance round, in metres; area is the squares that fit inside, in square metres.",
      "A triangle is half a rectangle; a parallelogram slides into one; a trapezium uses the average of its parallel sides.",
      "Scaling every side by a number scales the perimeter by it and the area by its square."
